# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type | title }})

Provides a RADIUS external authentication resource.

## Example Usage

```terraform
resource "wallix-bastion_externalauth_radius" "corporate" {
  authentication_name = "corporate_radius"
  host                = "radius.corporate.local"
  port                = 1812
  secret              = var.radius_shared_secret
  timeout             = 10
  description         = "Corporate RADIUS server"
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Usage Notes

`secret` is the RADIUS shared secret configured on the RADIUS server for this Bastion. `timeout`
is the authentication request timeout, in seconds.

## Import

RADIUS external authentication can be imported using the authentication name, e.g.

```shell
terraform import wallix-bastion_externalauth_radius.corporate corporate_radius
```
